        "author": "Vamelo",
        "id": null,
        "parent": "root",
        "text": "Marvelous work.\n\nMoira Fogarty has done an excellent job in presenting this work.  The sound quality itself is of the highest quality, however her enunciation and the timber of her voice, including her vocal range, makes this a pleasure to hear.\n\nAs Sun Tzu's Art of War can be a great temptation to make masculine, and authoritative Ms. Fogarty's straight forward and clear reading allows these ancient thoughts to enter the center of the consciousness.\n\nIf you're familiar with this work, her presentation is worth revisiting it for the pure enjoyment of the experience.  My compliments to Ms. Fogarty.",
