        "author": "Jon Smith 345",
        "id": null,
        "parent": "root",
        "text": "The Art of War by Sun Tzu in audiobookAn absolute classic! Listening to The Art of War by Sun Tzu in audiobook format brings a new depth to the ancient wisdom it holds. The narrator does a great job keeping the tone serious and engaging, which is perfect for absorbing such strategic and philosophical insights.This timeless work isn\u2019t just for military enthusiasts\u2014it offers valuable lessons for leadership, business, and even personal discipline.If you're looking for something more lighthearted after diving into such intense material, take a breather with <a href=\"https://doodlecricket.org/doodle-baseball/\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">Doodle Baseball</a>\u2014a fun and nostalgic game to relax your mind.Great job, LibriVox and Internet Archive, for keeping these classics alive and accessible!",
        "timestamp": 1749546292
      },
